<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (To bridge the gap between ambition and execution, entrepreneurship must be reframed as something tangible, visible, and achievable. The proposed Student Store Showcase accomplishes this by transforming abstract concepts into real, observable examples.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
301 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (This solution introduces a curated environment where students can explore real businesses built by their peers. Rather than learning through theoretical content or generalized advice, users engage directly with real-world implementations. By showcasing student-run stores across categories such as apparel, tutoring, creative services, and digital products, the platform enables users to understand what student businesses look like in practice: everything from how products are positioned and marketed to how storefronts are structured and organized.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
