347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (What works for this demographic isn't more features or better onboarding copy. It's meeting them where their actual barriers are: not knowing where to start, not wanting to waste time, and not seeing themselves as the kind of person who does this. Students need a low-stakes entry point, a structured path forward, and evidence that someone like them already made it work. Our Shopify for Students model didn't teach them to be entrepreneurs, it just made them feel like they already were one.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
