<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (When we tested it, 78% of participants found the content believable and trustworthy, and 66% responded positively to founder stories. The reactions weren't about the visuals, but about the fact that they could identify with it:)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (The industry default is to lead with capability. For this audience, leading with people is what actually converts, because the question students are really asking isn't "what does this platform do?" It's "is this platform for someone like me?")
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
